sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Control plane
  participant T as Token Service
  participant S as Secret Driver<br/>+ backend
  participant P as Provider
  Note over C,T: Sources and grants<br/>Admission is not readiness
  C->>T: Push versioned configuration
  T-->>C: Accepted generation
  T->>S: Authorized signing / refresh input
  S-->>T: Input or refusal
  Note over T,S: Input refusal blocks issuance
  T->>P: With input: proactively obtain / refresh
  P-->>T: Scoped token or failure
  Note over T: Report failure<br/>Readiness needs<br/>a usable token
  T-->>C: Warm readiness or failure status
  Note over C,T: Required token absent → block startup
